---
// The person behind it: a real photo and the reason, in their own words.
---
<section class="fd" aria-labelledby="fd-h">
  <div class="wrap fd-in">
    <img class="fd-photo reveal" src="/img/amulya-nidhi-desk-800.webp" srcset="/img/amulya-nidhi-desk-480.webp 480w, /img/amulya-nidhi-desk-800.webp 800w" sizes="(min-width: 62rem) 22rem, (min-width: 30rem) 20rem, 80vw" width="800" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Amulya Nidhi at work." />
    <div class="fd-copy">
      <h2 id="fd-h">Made by a candidate, for candidates.</h2>
      <blockquote class="fd-q">When I was job hunting, my applications landed in a pile. Nothing set them apart. GoodWord is what I wished I had.</blockquote>
      <p class="fd-by"><strong>Amulya Nidhi</strong>, Founder · <a class="link" href="/about/">Why I built it</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .fd { padding-block: var(--section); background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .fd-in { display: grid; gap: var(--s-6); align-items: center; }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) { .fd-in { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: var(--s-8); } }
  .fd-photo { width: min(100%, 20rem); aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--r-lg); background: var(--canvas); }
  @media (min-width: 62rem) { .fd-photo { width: 22rem; } }
  .fd-copy { display: grid; gap: var(--s-4); max-width: 36rem; }
  .fd-q { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--step-3); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--ink); }
  .fd-by { color: var(--ink-2); }
</style>
